Apple today released iOS 26.5.1, a minor update to <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ios-26/">iOS 26</a>. The software is available three weeks after iOS 26.5 came out, and appears to only be available for the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-air/">iPhone Air</a> and all models in the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-17/">iPhone 17</a> lineup.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/05/iOS-26.5.1-Feature.jpg" alt="" width="2500" height="1406" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1048978" /><br/>
The new software can be downloaded on eligible iPhones over-the-air by going to Settings &gt; General &gt; Software Update.<br/>
<br/>
According to Apple's release notes, the update fixes a <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/04/30/iphone-17-pro-iphone-air-charging-issue/">previously documented charging issue</a> with &zwnj;iPhone Air&zwnj; and &zwnj;iPhone 17&zwnj; models.<blockquote>This update addresses an issue for a small number of users that may prevent wired charging on iPhone Air and iPhone 17 models when the battery is nearly drained.</blockquote>Apple's work on &zwnj;iOS 26&zwnj; is winding down as it prepares to <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ios-27/">introduce iOS 27</a> at the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/wwdc/">June 8 WWDC keynote event</a>.<div class="linkback">Related Roundups: <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ios-26/">iOS 26</a>, <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipados-26/">iPadOS 26</a>, <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-17/">iPhone 17</a>, <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-air/">iPhone Air</a></div><div class="linkback">Buyer's Guide: <a href="https://buyersguide.macrumors.com/#iPhone-17">iPhone 17 (Neutral)</a>, <a href="https://buyersguide.macrumors.com/#iPhone-Air">iPhone Air (Neutral)</a></div><div class="linkback">Related Forums: <a href="https://forums.macrumors.com/forums/ios-26.248">iOS 26</a>, <a href="https://forums.macrumors.com/forums/iphone.99">iPhone</a></div><br/>This article, &quot;<a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/06/01/apple-releases-ios-26-5-1/">Apple Releases iOS 26.5.1 to Fix Charging Issue on iPhone Air and iPhone 17 Models</a>&quot; first appeared on <a href="https://www.macrumors.com">MacRumors.com</a><br/><br/><a href="https://forums.macrumors.com/threads/apple-releases-ios-26-5-1-to-fix-charging-issue-on-iphone-air-and-iphone-17-models.2483158/">Discuss this article</a> in our forums<br/><br/>